Dummy Checkpointer (Simplest Quick Fix)
Create a minimal in-memory checkpointer that does nothing:

python
from langgraph.checkpoint.base import BaseCheckpointSaver

class DummyCheckpointer(BaseCheckpointSaver):
    def get(self, config: dict) -> dict:
        return {}
    def put(self, config: dict, checkpoint: dict):
        pass

# Usage
workflow.compile(checkpointer=DummyCheckpointer())
